   574	
   575	    # ── Multiple-comparison correction (per pre-registered family) ────────
   576	    # Comparison families:
   577	    #   PRIMARY (m = N_cells):           3→5-mode lift (one per cell)
   578	    #   SECONDARY (m = 3 × N_cells):     per-arm drop-one (P-text/P-SoM/P-prompt)
