   173	    """Per-layer source-into-target patching, return causal-effect metrics.
   174	
   175	    Standard activation patching protocol (Meng et al. 2022 ROME-style):
   176	    1. Cache source's per-layer hidden states (source_cache[L])
   177	    2. Run target unperturbed → baseline target distribution
   178	    3. Run source unperturbed → baseline source distribution
