   185	                              (source_logit_src - target_logit_src). 1.0 = full
   186	                              shift to source, 0.0 = no shift.
   187	        kl_patched_to_source: KL(patched || source). Lower = closer to source.
   188	        kl_patched_to_target: KL(patched || target). Higher = further from target.
