   115	      - run_id: outer run dir name (e.g. B1_phantom_prompt_classifieds_20260501)
   116	      - observation_mode: extracted from summary if available, else from condition_meta.json
   117	      - episode_count: count of episode_*_summary_v2.json files in episodes/
   118	        (proxy for in-flight progress when full summary not yet generated)
